      "content": "<title id=\"ZZfkdTmMwoXuZMxswYHcqYRinkd\">小桐与肉肉｜三轮风格探索与渐进修正档案</title><p id=\"doxcnTqiYuVDKOC3GnRzXZGXGky\">项目：李依依提案·明星与连接。日期：2026-10-28。本档案统一保存第一轮、第二轮、第三轮生成图片与可追溯的修正过程。候选与退回稿均按当时状态保留，不等同于最终批准资产。</p><h1 id=\"doxcn9OfkxFqyauKhCjh1HB9cFJ\">阅读说明与迭代主线</h1><p id=\"doxcnkpdmCFhyoNSpR4sP165gWf\">第一轮探索软胶、毛绒、黏土和扁平的材质差异，但人物为儿童大头比例，反馈为太Q；肉肉两版也不够区分。第二轮改成修长手办，加入照片和姿态参考；生成过程多次向照片写实感漂移，虽修正材质和比例，最终仍被指出脸过于写实，且5与7的服装与参考过近。第三轮据此改为风格化优先：仅提取月牙笑眼与卧蚕、小鹅蛋圆下巴、长黑发三个辨识点，并使用明确的手办脸参考和原创服装。</p><p id=\"doxcnxjL6eAzr4RO9oTsJD1Keid\">下文每一轮分别保存任务依据、交付图、过程图、发现的问题、针对性修正与剩余差异。没有落盘或未返回的结果不虚构图片或成功记录。参考照片仅作为生成输入，不混入候选图。</p><h1 id=\"doxcnE676S5dqyh2Js0h6sT2epf\">第一轮：Q版材质探索</h1><p id=\"doxcnTKzhEAyTR6TPJ66jwjw2wb\">目标为约2.5头身的小桐四种质感和肉肉两种质感。过程先去除当时任务禁止的蝴蝶装饰，保留桐叶铃铛；潮玩修正版成为赤足。扁平初稿偏精细二次元，重画为干净大色块与少量硬边阴影。随后用户反馈：整体太Q，03的质感最好；狗两版过像。</p><img id=\"doxcnjppd4tbFJ39ytLWvAU6z9b\" name=\"overview.png\" caption=\"第一轮｜overview&#xA;\" height=\"511\" mime=\"image/png\" scale=\"1.000000\" src=\"AFN3bsCrpooFApx8yytcpdX6nud\" width=\"1000\"/><img id=\"doxcnfl2mbCF8wzAPTXBO3S4yWc\" name=\"xiaotong-1-vinyl.png\" caption=\"第一轮｜xiaotong-1-vinyl&#xA;\" height=\"667\" mime=\"image/png\" scale=\"1.000000\" src=\"EAewbnjj0oU4ONxs4wecULY9nUh\" width=\"1000\"/><img id=\"doxcnEWEub2G5m4gRrREHZ8tfMf\" name=\"xiaotong-2-plush.png\" caption=\"第一轮｜xiaotong-2-plush&#xA;\" height=\"667\" mime=\"image/png\" scale=\"1.000000\" src=\"GiqVbMAxtoiVn2xsfaYcN0KfnNc\" width=\"1000\"/><img id=\"doxcnXUxExL1f1SJW5d2yo4Qc5d\" name=\"xiaotong-3-clay.png\" caption=\"第一轮｜xiaotong-3-clay&#xA;\" height=\"667\" mime=\"image/png\" scale=\"1.000000\" src=\"Sp76bYAJJoDHYUxPgNecoFzKneb\" width=\"1000\"/><img id=\"doxcnrMRfWDScSmfDLJ6f064FZe\" name=\"xiaotong-4-flat.png\" caption=\"第一轮｜xiaotong-4-flat&#xA;\" height=\"667\" mime=\"image/png\" scale=\"1.000000\" src=\"Lp26b3isWoOnSDxzHJZc6UwhnCf\" width=\"1000\"/><img id=\"doxcnp53E5q34FcTrGCnSkcRwpc\" name=\"rourou-1-vinyl.png\" caption=\"第一轮｜rourou-1-vinyl&#xA;\" height=\"667\" mime=\"image/png\" scale=\"1.000000\" src=\"J9NrboRZSoATfKxHdXccjFZgnag\" width=\"1000\"/><img id=\"doxcndezd9d6G0CU9mNtU984ZTo\" name=\"rourou-2-plush.png\" caption=\"第一轮｜rourou-2-plush&#xA;\" height=\"667\" mime=\"image/png\" scale=\"1.000000\" src=\"IrPCbP4TXoxxjixx3kmclR9XnPf\" width=\"1000\"/><p id=\"doxcnyAayM4sQwfmNf7VNx4Pl3d\"><b>渐进修正：扁平风。</b>初稿出现细发丝、精细针织和二次元柔和阴影，不符合扁平；随后减少材质纹理，换成整块发形和硬边色块，最终图已列于上文。</p><img id=\"doxcnzuVpWBLyHAGFTsoCljMEae\" name=\"xiaotong-4-flat-initial.png\" caption=\"第一轮过程｜扁平初稿：偏二次元，已被替换&#xA;\" height=\"667\" mime=\"image/png\" scale=\"1.000000\" src=\"AbxZbXoQEoa9ctx9zFZcxE6ynyh\" width=\"1000\"/><h2 id=\"doxcnfcUOpfsPQmJNoW61WwcBMg\">桐铃logo交付</h2><p id=\"doxcnHpZ0RHBbUkOwI8CQTPlIFe\">三份纯路径SVG（实心/线稿/反白）与512透明PNG。已检查24px和40px可读性，旧文件有备份。</p><img id=\"doxcnMscG4ZaMkQwNlNHblzw8hg\" name=\"logo-preview.png\" caption=\"桐铃logo三版本与小尺寸预览&#xA;\" height=\"417\" mime=\"image/png\" scale=\"1.000000\" src=\"WoWvbimvNoviAGxJJ4Yctvb6n3e\" width=\"1000\"/><img id=\"doxcnQxD7kkgkWgfrwBe6TF2Jie\" name=\"logo-a-512.png\" caption=\"主logo｜512×512透明PNG&#xA;\" height=\"1000\" mime=\"image/png\" scale=\"1.000000\" src=\"VcZDbFwQeotAuKx24a9cjQd0nwb\" width=\"1000\"/><figure id=\"doxcnyaABA6UMMAgsoAUUVVln5b\" view-type=\"Card\"><source id=\"doxcn4THzfaU6LjhTinvz6XiqDH\" name=\"xiaotong-prompts.json\" mime=\"application/json\" size=\"5092\" token=\"J692bkSoroVcpZxJH7AcCra7n4e\"/></figure><figure id=\"doxcnsTqPBio9qr8aLBtFX4zoSh\" view-type=\"Card\"><source id=\"doxcnP86OmFrFhe2FR8CiySj3Aa\" name=\"xiaotong-flat-rework-prompt.txt\" mime=\"text/plain; charset=utf-8\" size=\"1239\" token=\"A2sGbQey4oPcrzxSZtIcgbqrnWC\"/></figure><figure id=\"doxcnFSEql0XcZUcBGUo61rOD0f\" view-type=\"Card\"><source id=\"doxcn68IdY6amLUls3Hu87hACHe\" name=\"rourou-generation.md\" mime=\"text/markdown; charset=utf-8\" size=\"2556\" token=\"ChoCboY0VoKS11x1a8LcTUHznkb\"/></figure><figure id=\"doxcnLdFdIske2h1h4R3BvhmlDb\" view-type=\"Card\"><source id=\"doxcn0QPwsaf3PCbiit0jBDzvxh\" name=\"verification.json\" mime=\"application/json\" size=\"2947\" token=\"JWAmbwjDXoKC8AxrXglc07sTnPu\"/></figure><figure id=\"doxcnuN0Zkj07JeSTsBURKbADGf\" view-type=\"Card\"><source id=\"doxcn9Rq4E2JxalZDgMk3Rnb3J5\" name=\"logo-a.svg\" mime=\"image/svg+xml\" size=\"502\" token=\"C8RrbMA9poMTKtxvQTgcstlBnDf\"/></figure><figure id=\"doxcn9eZrWCHRyvtG5XJgq4OePd\" view-type=\"Card\"><source id=\"doxcnkkck6SQWjeQNV6sxoPIiWf\" name=\"logo-c.svg\" mime=\"image/svg+xml\" size=\"502\" token=\"R19lbOPndoyFdix6FXhcgjdHnZy\"/></figure><figure id=\"doxcnbIdG6mYzvXfY3TV8wlbred\" view-type=\"Card\"><source id=\"doxcnJGcaGMb2nzohEGINRcM3kd\" name=\"logo-b.svg\" mime=\"image/svg+xml\" size=\"372\" token=\"JX5rbFaU3oAeKsx9mRLcEqdKn1g\"/></figure><h1 id=\"doxcnfqsfABg75LxquypSNyIxVg\">第二轮：修长手办与照片参考</h1><p id=\"doxcnrnlWOrQ97W2oELN4sj05ee\">目标变为人物5款、肉肉4款，保留第一轮。开始时指定参考目录未见图片，通用设定任务被中断且未得到可保存结果；用户补充6张手办与7张脸图后，实际看图并传入参考重新生成。没有虚构-generic成品。</p><p id=\"doxcn6VxPuTzZlJ81fN9HBcoipc\">参考职责：figure01对应黏土，02对应PVC比V，03对应侧身机能，05对应街头；04仅比例光影，06只材质。照片提取脸型、眉眼、鼻唇和笑容。后续问题表明照片权重过强，应进一步降级为三个辨识点。</p><img id=\"doxcngXMbOzB2qhXMDvDfqfZPE3\" name=\"overview-2.png\" caption=\"第二轮历史候选｜overview-2&#xA;\" height=\"300\" mime=\"image/png\" scale=\"1.000000\" src=\"Kazyb6kSNoQiCcxkgLecZzcrnCg\" width=\"1000\"/><img id=\"doxcnXNmFSd7C8dsiJFfJhtMTSh\" name=\"pairs-2.png\" caption=\"第二轮历史候选｜pairs-2&#xA;\" height=\"489\" mime=\"image/png\" scale=\"1.000000\" src=\"B3zcbKyD8obHfDx9vnicY3L1n4d\" width=\"1000\"/><img id=\"doxcnZPLVvUHdAKYSvnKbPF5zDd\" name=\"xiaotong-5-pvc-rejected.png\" caption=\"第二轮历史候选｜xiaotong-5-pvc（后续被用户退回）&#xA;\" height=\"667\" mime=\"image/png\" scale=\"1.000000\" src=\"Ck47bMprPoAjcSxmttHc0SL0nQc\" width=\"1000\"/><img id=\"doxcnCTuOlNY96QzhVwB3TFKKtg\" name=\"xiaotong-6-clay-slim.png\" caption=\"第二轮历史候选｜xiaotong-6-clay-slim&#xA;\" height=\"667\" mime=\"image/png\" scale=\"1.000000\" src=\"OqkUbnUVHovIuOxg4AqcT0Z6nbh\" width=\"1000\"/><img id=\"doxcnVWaZegQK4MsuNLCc7s9Ldh\" name=\"xiaotong-7-street-rejected.png\" caption=\"第二轮历史候选｜xiaotong-7-street（后续被用户退回）&#xA;\" height=\"667\" mime=\"image/png\" scale=\"1.000000\" src=\"HFnkbJLMRoBuqixDkoLcdrOfn5d\" width=\"1000\"/><img id=\"doxcnrQqATLICrQvQfX4BQbOhxe\" name=\"xiaotong-8-toon3d.png\" caption=\"第二轮历史候选｜xiaotong-8-toon3d&#xA;\" height=\"667\" mime=\"image/png\" scale=\"1.000000\" src=\"KUlBbJeFSobJ1pxa16Hc6k4ynTb\" width=\"1000\"/><img id=\"doxcnriVFQT0m9ygDlU5sp8wo7g\" name=\"xiaotong-9-film.png\" caption=\"第二轮历史候选｜xiaotong-9-film&#xA;\" height=\"667\" mime=\"image/png\" scale=\"1.000000\" src=\"OVojb6sb5oHusJx0MTCcyQUwnLg\" width=\"1000\"/><img id=\"doxcnTaIYKIepQEUliIK9Szu0Yc\" name=\"rourou-3-figure.png\" caption=\"第二轮历史候选｜rourou-3-figure&#xA;\" height=\"667\" mime=\"image/png\" scale=\"1.000000\" src=\"Je0mbkNFqoGnOCxmbcPcMcwHnIb\" width=\"1000\"/><img id=\"doxcnqjN9OsVXyS2N8swNNOqlQb\" name=\"rourou-4-clay.png\" caption=\"第二轮历史候选｜rourou-4-clay&#xA;\" height=\"667\" mime=\"image/png\" scale=\"1.000000\" src=\"IwPzbbwvhoxfu9xQvf6cQQq4nzb\" width=\"1000\"/><img id=\"doxcnjWMPApETTELl4B4lY0jSfg\" name=\"rourou-5-toon.png\" caption=\"第二轮历史候选｜rourou-5-toon&#xA;\" height=\"667\" mime=\"image/png\" scale=\"1.000000\" src=\"PTKIbtq2Uo0NqIxrZdGcoWxzntf\" width=\"1000\"/><img id=\"doxcnzWZdL5LtSPRBxq66KuCfxw\" name=\"rourou-6-line.png\" caption=\"第二轮历史候选｜rourou-6-line&#xA;\" height=\"667\" mime=\"image/png\" scale=\"1.000000\" src=\"LRhFbhnxZoE3xQx5M7Lc5LJwnzg\" width=\"1000\"/><h2 id=\"doxcnyXgzDG7eXOKhlwkmItGwYc\">第二轮渐进过程：先识别漂移，再定点修正</h2><p id=\"doxcnxmqUZ24LrmJrq67UgSrlEh\">以下是实际保留的过程稿，不作为合格交付。每次仅针对暴露的问题修正，保留原图以便比较。</p><p id=\"doxcnIhqBHIMOhOxSaO1QfSqLVg\">5初稿：照片权重过高，偏真人棚拍；下一步将手办参考置前，要求雕塑发束、无毛孔喷涂皮肤与6.5头身。</p><img id=\"doxcnLkyQjwFVSeQaNpxGq5soOb\" name=\"xiaotong-5-overreal.png\" caption=\"第二轮过程｜xiaotong-5-overreal&#xA;\" height=\"667\" mime=\"image/png\" scale=\"1.000000\" src=\"JaA0bsN0Homl9dxtqV3cyRPinnd\" width=\"1000\"/><p id=\"doxcny67ykSJJPwUQwQVKtBwgmd\">6初稿：黏土方向变成写实皮肤与衣料；下一步加强哑光粗发束和简化鼻嘴。</p><img id=\"doxcnvmuy4W3vYMJDnrieHSvIWd\" name=\"xiaotong-6-overreal.png\" caption=\"第二轮过程｜xiaotong-6-overreal&#xA;\" height=\"667\" mime=\"image/png\" scale=\"1.000000\" src=\"YvJgb4REKo9mzfxxwQ4cRH5anYf\" width=\"1000\"/><p id=\"doxcnSoCm90CmKFgr0cFEhyZZkg\">6中间稿：眼型偏通用动漫且刘海擦眼；下一步用正脸与笑脸重新约束平眉杏眼、卧蚕圆下巴，并露出眼睛。</p><img id=\"doxcnCF2LNkR54UUyzjaqS08jre\" name=\"xiaotong-6-pre-identity-correction.png\" caption=\"第二轮过程｜xiaotong-6-pre-identity-correction&#xA;\" height=\"667\" mime=\"image/png\" scale=\"1.000000\" src=\"OADabfFgRopO4uxm0UyczRDUnqf\" width=\"1000\"/><p id=\"doxcndqOYIpQUPF0ahVHZZrtqVe\">7初稿：潮玩变为真人时装；下一步改为哑光软胶雕塑与约4.8头身。</p><img id=\"doxcnq3AbzgyOR9iXV2uAzVZVXg\" name=\"xiaotong-7-overreal.png\" caption=\"第二轮过程｜xiaotong-7-overreal&#xA;\" height=\"667\" mime=\"image/png\" scale=\"1.000000\" src=\"Czt0bAtRkokdc6xrHVic2yypnYd\" width=\"1000\"/><p id=\"doxcnjD6QwdiGqxfFNDuJFPnZtd\">7中间稿：多出视图、比例仍偏长；下一步限制为仅左全身右特写，缩回约5头身。</p><img id=\"doxcnnDqryc51ZlvLo2zL5x46Kf\" name=\"xiaotong-7-extra-views.png\" caption=\"第二轮过程｜xiaotong-7-extra-views&#xA;\" height=\"667\" mime=\"image/png\" scale=\"1.000000\" src=\"HA84bz51Ro1v7gxtrtYcHeXGnOc\" width=\"1000\"/><p id=\"doxcnbUoSnssv3rNWQqnscfnPhf\">8初稿：偏半写实3D；下一步改为两三档硬边色块和细描边，保留侧身姿态。</p><img id=\"doxcnOxwvBQhHnH1eqkrbp75MUb\" name=\"xiaotong-8-initial-semireal.png\" caption=\"第二轮过程｜xiaotong-8-initial-semireal&#xA;\" height=\"667\" mime=\"image/png\" scale=\"1.000000\" src=\"RbNYby3whoyNwqxU0BUc0DvDnph\" width=\"1000\"/><p id=\"doxcn49JFTpVA4B4LNjkGKK1Jtg\">9初稿：偏半写实；下一步改为动画雕塑发束与无毛孔皮肤，保留脸部几何。</p><img id=\"doxcn8rsaT5DaA8V6DFWwBD2CpF\" name=\"xiaotong-9-initial-semireal.png\" caption=\"第二轮过程｜xiaotong-9-initial-semireal&#xA;\" height=\"667\" mime=\"image/png\" scale=\"1.000000\" src=\"PhMsbH7mRopzmpxbYPfcsTB5nMf\" width=\"1000\"/><h2 id=\"doxcnogFQL655qGqpimSaf6Fa0e\">第二轮复核与用户退回</h2><p id=\"doxcnIQXficyfOqJycfg7KzCmsd\">自检时已发现：5眼睛偏大、6黏土简化不足、7通用潮玩脸、8下颌偏利落、9理想化动画脸；五款月牙笑眼都不突出。当时报告未声称身份相似度获批准。</p><p id=\"doxcnS3y9WHxn4eR27UHNYRIYgb\">用户进一步指出两项关键失败：脸仍是写实皮肤、鼻唇、睫毛和妆容；5和7的服装与参考过近。因此5和7现已从候选目录移动至rejected，原文件追加-rejected后缀。上文是历史图档，不是当前推荐。</p><img id=\"doxcnboNQch0PRSu8VxLHhohqCh\" name=\"round2-too-realistic-feedback.png\" caption=\"用户提供的第二轮反面例子｜写实脸与服装复制问题&#xA;\" height=\"1296\" mime=\"image/png\" scale=\"1.000000\" src=\"JVMQbyoumoMDxPxWjQIc82ZKnxf\" width=\"1000\"/><figure id=\"doxcn6PgIe0YPV0SZxlqwj9i8kh\" view-type=\"Card\"><source id=\"doxcnXdejFCKn6HuSpu5tX45zJe\" name=\"round2-a.json\" mime=\"application/json\" size=\"14211\" token=\"DmZIbDjWhoKYjIx13jdcj6zFn4c\"/></figure><figure id=\"doxcn0qzbb6ZvSF2uwKpaavtC3f\" view-type=\"Card\"><source id=\"doxcnxw0S2WQb8Jwd51ofgekZMc\" name=\"round2-a-clay-final.json\" mime=\"application/json\" size=\"1054\" token=\"UhXobm5uFoIjqHxOfPPcCckFnue\"/></figure><figure id=\"doxcnnOCZ8YzBoqHv8Wog2y2h0c\" view-type=\"Card\"><source id=\"doxcnzc9GZ4mpi997e2Zyq74mDd\" name=\"round2-b.json\" mime=\"application/json\" size=\"6566\" token=\"B9C5bTDpXo44XexBtSNcsxKNnpf\"/></figure><figure id=\"doxcnE7vl0XXJHrd86RX2rQziif\" view-type=\"Card\"><source id=\"doxcnHEE4l0esnYsuyhmmnto6Jd\" name=\"round2-dog.json\" mime=\"application/json\" size=\"7836\" token=\"XmiObliXRoNnWfx7Zoic2wCon4d\"/></figure><figure id=\"doxcniMFWpcRqZ1Nh1pKTPxxjXd\" view-type=\"Card\"><source id=\"doxcn4Jq0djmaPPXcpztQupQfPf\" name=\"round2-review.md\" mime=\"text/markdown; charset=utf-8\" size=\"978\" token=\"ZamCb0LNuoBaQYx3CW5c5VZ2nGb\"/></figure><figure id=\"doxcnxpG5ACIwmoEwzfxcktrbac\" view-type=\"Card\"><source id=\"doxcnkOcnmpH2wke8Po8nYvNF1a\" name=\"round2-verification.json\" mime=\"application/json\" size=\"2851\" token=\"QxXdbQCpiocXMGxIFUEc49DtnTZ\"/></figure><figure id=\"doxcn595zNdJqpdqOJ1cCoga4vh\" view-type=\"Card\"><source id=\"doxcnkyeRhx0PWRw6geVUcKn1mf\" name=\"codex-图片生成提示词-第五批-桐铃logo-Q版小桐-肉肉.md\" mime=\"text/markdown; charset=utf-8\" size=\"14526\" token=\"IlHSbT9P9oNYgqxfQHmcFwtQnhF\"/></figure><h1 id=\"doxcnSeNHWspAPJk4pgHoD04hMd\">第三轮：风格化优先与原创服装</h1><p id=\"doxcnJX766uYBIDNnmWSnuc7mlb\">接下来按第三轮补充任务生成6张小桐、2张肉肉，另做总览及2组配对。脸参考优先使用style-face01/02/03，只保留照片的三个辨识点；禁止西装、格纹裙、领带、堆堆袜、乐福鞋和卫衣加工装裤。每张头特写须对照手办脸参考，出现写实脸即重画。生成过程与最终候选将在本节继续追加。</p><figure id=\"doxcnfSYGWTXT7RegwiS9knhFLc\" view-type=\"Card\"><source id=\"doxcnlJyhgLGBj6SUGImo8THyMe\" name=\"codex-图片生成提示词-第五批补充-小桐手办风第三轮.md\" mime=\"text/markdown; charset=utf-8\" size=\"5021\" token=\"JqPCb7T2uoo6INx3sdecj1pEnYg\"/></figure><h2 id=\"doxcnksO4uDduUbzCwyGfTTHFrf\">补充找回的原始过程输出</h2><p id=\"doxcnFKsScmHrGONqSLClvamQlg\">从本次生成工具的原始输出目录补回以下图片。1是扁平定稿的原始编码副本；2/3为第一轮毛绒与软胶修正前原稿；4为第二轮街头比例修正前稿；5为黏土眼型与身份修正前稿。保留原图与源路径，不冒充新增合格候选。</p><img id=\"doxcn9FJWtGlRI53B9okRel1nqb\" name=\"recovered-1.png\" caption=\"找回的过程原图 1｜未作为新增候选&#xA;\" height=\"667\" mime=\"image/png\" scale=\"1.000000\" src=\"EEMSbS4S2oiCSHxHX3mceCVvnS7\" width=\"1000\"/><img id=\"doxcnmT4pg09uzNWq1dqKNh5CPf\" name=\"recovered-2.png\" caption=\"找回的过程原图 2｜未作为新增候选&#xA;\" height=\"667\" mime=\"image/png\" scale=\"1.000000\" src=\"BwQmbWiobog0aUx6yZBc1EtRnej\" width=\"1000\"/><img id=\"doxcnVnpUVLDQwiOhpB8CauRV9g\" name=\"recovered-3.png\" caption=\"找回的过程原图 3｜未作为新增候选&#xA;\" height=\"667\" mime=\"image/png\" scale=\"1.000000\" src=\"DaMgbYJdVojM7pxp2QMcuGG6nfb\" width=\"1000\"/><img id=\"doxcnol3dkB7icx7cQ3rKZ3zMkc\" name=\"recovered-4.png\" caption=\"找回的过程原图 4｜未作为新增候选&#xA;\" height=\"667\" mime=\"image/png\" scale=\"1.000000\" src=\"Nccqbc7EFoOV3DxQUNscWHEDn4b\" width=\"1000\"/><img id=\"doxcnztouovoGfps16yaxKIwOoe\" name=\"recovered-5.png\" caption=\"找回的过程原图 5｜未作为新增候选&#xA;\" height=\"667\" mime=\"image/png\" scale=\"1.000000\" src=\"HOffb5JHzoG5KixGcawcmCwHnfh\" width=\"1000\"/><figure id=\"doxcndfQTuPZpHSYFjw0DXNsaCe\" view-type=\"Card\"><source id=\"doxcnhwmiwqQ23N83Zj0mVXLZx5\" name=\"sources.json\" mime=\"application/json\" size=\"1092\" token=\"G0hBbX7jXow3sgxkRY1cPTNbnue\"/></figure>",
